#: ../guide/faq.md:160 cfbc42a4114b4d448b7fde878b5efa84
msgid ""
"An equity-based reward that fires every bar (see [Customizing Trading "
"Environment](customize_environment.md))."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/faq.md:162 bd3b9ad439af40b5ad1a50f634cede51
msgid ""
"An action scheme that forces flat at episode end (so trades close for "
"sure)."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/faq.md:164 648376f1de7b48d98cbca627d7af30eb
msgid "A higher episode count — sparse reward + long episodes is hard."
msgstr ""

